        "html": "<body>\n\n\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Case Disney — Hyper Island</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,700&amp;family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,300;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n:root {\n  --hi-black: #F5F4F0;\n  --hi-white: #111110;\n  --hi-orange: #FF7300;\n  --hi-gray: #ECEAE4;\n  --hi-gray-mid: #D4D1C8;\n  --hi-gray-light: #888580;\n  --hi-gray-pale: #444240;\n  --hi-accent: #2A2927;\n  --font-body: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n  --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n  --spacing-md: 2rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n  --spacing-xl: 8rem;\n}\n\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--hi-black);\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\nh1, h2, h3, h4 {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n}\n\n/* HERO */\n.case-hero {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-image { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; }\n.hero-bg-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.45; }\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,10,0.1) 0%, rgba(10,10,10,0.2) 35%, rgba(10,10,10,0.85) 72%, #0A0A0A 100%);\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.case-label {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.case-label::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: block;\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-client-logo { margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); }\n.hero-client-logo img {\n  height: 44px;\n  width: auto;\n  filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\n  opacity: 0.92;\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 6rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  max-width: 900px;\n}\n\n.hero-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--hi-orange); }\n\n.hero-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  padding-top: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n}\n\n.hero-meta-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }\n\n.meta-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n\n.meta-value {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n.scroll-indicator {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: var(--spacing-lg);\n  bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.scroll-indicator span {\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  transform: rotate(180deg);\n}\n\n.scroll-line {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 60px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--hi-orange), transparent);\n  animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes scrollPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.7); }\n  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1); }\n}\n\n/* INTRO */\n.intro-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar { position: sticky; top: var(--spacing-lg); }\n\n.intro-number {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 5rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.25);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n.intro-body p:first-child {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--hi-accent);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  padding-left: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.intro-body p {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n/* PROJECTS INDEX — índice dos dois projetos no fundo escuro */\n.projects-index {\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.projects-index-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }\n\n.projects-index-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.projects-index-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 2px;\n}\n\n.project-index-card {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.project-index-card::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0; left: 0;\n  width: 3px;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n}\n\n.project-index-card.active::before {\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.project-index-number {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n}\n\n.project-index-card.active .project-index-number {\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.4);\n}\n\n.project-index-tag {\n  font-size: 0.62rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);\n}\n\n.project-index-card.active .project-index-tag { color: var(--hi-orange); }\n\n.project-index-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n.project-index-desc {\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);\n  max-width: 380px;\n}\n\n.project-index-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  margin-top: auto;\n  padding-top: var(--spacing-sm);\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n}\n\n.project-index-meta-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; }\n.project-index-meta-item .meta-label { font-size: 0.58rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }\n.project-index-meta-item .meta-value { font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82); }\n\n/* CHAPTER DIVIDER — separador forte entre os dois projetos */\n.chapter-divider {\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.chapter-divider-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  width: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.chapter-divider-number {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.85;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.18);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.chapter-divider-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }\n\n.chapter-divider-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.55);\n}\n\n.chapter-divider-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n/* STATS BAND — fundo escuro dentro dos projetos */\n.stats-band {\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n}\n\n.stats-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }\n\n.stat-number {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.stat-desc {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n}\n\n/* PROJECT SECTION */\n.project-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.project-section + .project-section { padding-top: 0; }\n\n.section-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);\n  padding-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n}\n\n.section-year {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.85;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.section-year.accent { -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--hi-orange); }\n\n.section-header-content { padding-top: 1rem; }\n\n.section-tag {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.section-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* CONTENT GRIDS */\n.content-grid { display: grid; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n.content-grid.two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n.content-grid.text-image { grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr; align-items: start; }\n.content-grid.image-text { grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; align-items: start; }\n\n.content-text p {\n  font-size: 0.975rem;\n  line-height: 1.85;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.content-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.content-text strong { color: var(--hi-white); font-weight: 600; }\n\n.content-text h3 {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n/* APPROACH LIST */\n.approach-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.approach-item { display: flex; gap: var(--spacing-md); align-items: flex-start; }\n\n.approach-number {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 3rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 3rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content h4 {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n/* HIGHLIGHT BOX */\n.highlight-box {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  position: relative;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.highlight-box::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.highlight-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.highlight-text {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* QUOTE BLOCK */\n.quote-block {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.quote-block::before {\n  content: '\"';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -1rem; right: var(--spacing-md);\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.1;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.quote-text {\n  font-size: 1.15rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-style: italic;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n/* SKILL BADGES */\n.skill-badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin: var(--spacing-md) 0; }\n\n.skill-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n}\n\n.skill-badge.orange {\n  border-color: var(--hi-orange);\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  background: rgba(255,115,0,0.06);\n}\n\n/* MEDIA */\n.media-image { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-fit: cover; display: block; }\n.media-image.portrait { aspect-ratio: 3/4; }\n.media-image.wide { aspect-ratio: 16/9; }\n\n.fullwidth-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-height: 580px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* PHOTO GALLERIES */\n.photo-gallery { display: grid; gap: 6px; margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0; }\n.photo-gallery.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n.photo-gallery.grid-3 .gallery-item { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }\n.photo-gallery.grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\n.photo-gallery.grid-4 .gallery-item { aspect-ratio: 3/4; }\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-left-tall {\n  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\n  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n  height: 480px;\n}\n.photo-gallery.gallery-left-tall .gi-tall { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; }\n.photo-gallery.gallery-left-tall .gi-small { grid-column: 2; }\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-right-tall {\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n  height: 480px;\n}\n.photo-gallery.gallery-right-tall .gi-small { grid-column: 1; }\n.photo-gallery.gallery-right-tall .gi-tall { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / 3; }\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-mixed {\n  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;\n  height: 420px;\n}\n.photo-gallery.gallery-mixed .gallery-item { height: 100%; }\n\n.gallery-item { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }\n.gallery-item img {\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover; display: block;\n  transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n}\n.gallery-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }\n\n/* VIDEO REELS */\n.video-reel-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-xl);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.video-reel-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.video-reel-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.video-reel-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.video-reel-item video {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 9/16;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.video-reel-caption {\n  padding: 0.6rem 0 0.2rem;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n}\n\n/* SECTION DIVIDER */\n.section-divider { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--spacing-lg); }\n.section-divider hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid); }\n\n/* TESTIMONIAL FEATURE — depoimento redesenhado, fundo escuro, destaque visual forte */\n.testimonial-feature {\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature::before {\n  content: '\"';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -3rem;\n  left: var(--spacing-lg);\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 22rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.08);\n  pointer-events: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 4px 1fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  align-items: start;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-mark {\n  width: 4px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  align-self: stretch;\n  min-height: 100%;\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.35rem);\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-style: italic;\n  line-height: 1.75;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-author {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-author-line {\n  width: 2.5rem;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-name {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n.testimonial-feature-role {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  margin-top: 0.2rem;\n}\n\n/* CLOSING */\n.closing-section {\n  background: var(--hi-gray);\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.closing-section::before {\n  content: 'HYPER\\AISLAND';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: -2rem; right: -1rem;\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 10rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  white-space: pre;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.closing-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: center;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.closing-client-logo { margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); }\n.closing-client-logo img { height: 38px; width: auto; opacity: 0.85; }\n\n.closing-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.closing-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.closing-text {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n.cta-block {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.cta-block-title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.cta-block p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.75);\n}\n\n.cta-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n  align-self: flex-start;\n}\n\n.cta-button:hover { background: #333; }\n\n/* ANIMATION */\n.fade-up {\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(30px);\n  transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;\n}\n\n.fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n\n/* RESPONSIVE */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  :root { --spacing-lg: 2rem; --spacing-xl: 4rem; }\n  .intro-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n  .intro-sidebar { position: static; }\n  .intro-number { font-size: 5rem; }\n  .projects-index-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2px; }\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .content-grid.two-col,\n  .content-grid.text-image,\n  .content-grid.image-text { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-left-tall,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-right-tall { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; height: 320px; }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-mixed { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; height: auto; }\n  .video-reel-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .closing-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .section-header { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n  .section-year { font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 8rem); }\n  .hero-meta { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n  .chapter-divider-number { font-size: 3.5rem; }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-left-tall,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-right-tall { grid-template-columns: 1fr; height: auto; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-left-tall .gi-tall,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-right-tall .gi-tall { grid-column: 1; grid-row: auto; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-left-tall .gi-small,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-right-tall .gi-small { grid-column: 1; aspect-ratio: 4/3; }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-3,\n  .photo-gallery.grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-mixed { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .video-reel-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .hero-meta { gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n<!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"case-hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg-image\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_145338180.jpg?v=1777937593\" alt=\"Disney — Hyper Island\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-content\">\n    <div class=\"case-label\">Case de Transformação</div>\n    <div class=\"hero-client-logo\">\n      <img src=\"https://farscapedevelopment.co.uk/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/DISNEY-LOGO-WHITE-520x160.png\" alt=\"Disney\">\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Formar quem vai<br><em>contar</em> as próximas<br>histórias</h1>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Cliente</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">The Walt Disney Company</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Projetos</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">2 programas</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Países</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">México, Argentina &amp; Brasil</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scroll-indicator\">\n    <div class=\"scroll-line\"></div>\n    <span>Scroll</span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<!-- ==================== INTRO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"intro-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"intro-sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"intro-number\">DISNEY</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-label\">A parceria</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-title\">Dois projetos.<br>Um princípio.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"intro-body\">\n    <p>Poucas empresas no mundo têm uma relação tão profunda com o desenvolvimento humano quanto a Disney. Quando ela escolheu a Hyper Island como parceira para dois dos seus principais programas na América Latina, essa escolha não foi acidental.</p>\n    <p>Ela revela uma afinidade metodológica entre as duas organizações: a crença de que pessoas aprendem fazendo, que o contexto importa tanto quanto o conteúdo, e que o melhor aprendizado acontece quando há algo real em jogo.</p>\n    <p>Abaixo, você encontra os dois projetos que desenvolvemos juntos — diferentes em formato, duração e objetivo, mas unidos pelo mesmo princípio de sempre.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<!-- ==================== ÍNDICE DOS PROJETOS ==================== -->\n<div class=\"projects-index fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"projects-index-inner\">\n    <div class=\"projects-index-label\">Nessa página você vai encontrar</div>\n    <div class=\"projects-index-grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"project-index-card active\">\n        <div class=\"project-index-number\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"project-index-tag\">Programa de Trainees</div>\n        <div class=\"project-index-title\">Disney Learning Journey</div>\n        <p class=\"project-index-desc\">Uma jornada híbrida de quatro meses com trainees do México, Argentina e Brasil — desenhada para desenvolver criatividade, empreendedorismo e influência por meio da metodologia 3U.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-index-meta\">\n          <div class=\"project-index-meta-item\">\n            <span class=\"meta-label\">Duração</span>\n            <span class=\"meta-value\">4 meses</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"project-index-meta-item\">\n            <span class=\"meta-label\">Formato</span>\n            <span class=\"meta-value\">Híbrido</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"project-index-meta-item\">\n            <span class=\"meta-label\">Sessões</span>\n            <span class=\"meta-value\">12 encontros</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"project-index-card active\">\n        <div class=\"project-index-number\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"project-index-tag\">Hackathon Transregional</div>\n        <div class=\"project-index-title\">Voices with Vision</div>\n        <p class=\"project-index-desc\">Um hackathon de um único dia reunindo talentos selecionados da Disney de diferentes países para desenvolver e apresentar protótipos reais — com os melhores projetos avançando para colaboração crossregion.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-index-meta\">\n          <div class=\"project-index-meta-item\">\n            <span class=\"meta-label\">Duração</span>\n            <span class=\"meta-value\">1 dia</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"project-index-meta-item\">\n            <span class=\"meta-label\">Formato</span>\n            <span class=\"meta-value\">Presencial</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"project-index-meta-item\">\n            <span class=\"meta-label\">Escopo</span>\n            <span class=\"meta-value\">América Latina</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- ================================================================ -->\n<!--  PROJETO 01 — DISNEY LEARNING JOURNEY                            -->\n<!-- ================================================================ -->\n\n<div class=\"chapter-divider fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"chapter-divider-inner\">\n    <div class=\"chapter-divider-number\">01</div>\n    <div class=\"chapter-divider-content\">\n      <div class=\"chapter-divider-label\">Programa de Trainees</div>\n      <div class=\"chapter-divider-title\">Disney Learning Journey</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"stats-band fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"stats-inner\">\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">4 meses</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Jornada híbrida contínua</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">12</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Sessões estruturadas</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">3 países</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">México, Argentina e Brasil simultâneos</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"project-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <div class=\"section-year accent\">3U</div>\n    <div class=\"section-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"section-tag\">A metodologia</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Uncover, Unlock<br>&amp; Unleash</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid text-image\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>O <strong>Disney Learning Journey</strong> foi concebido para complementar e fortalecer o Graduate Trainee Program da Disney na América Latina — alcançando trainees no México, Argentina e Brasil ao longo de quatro meses em formato híbrido.</p>\n      <p>O desafio era sofisticado: os trainees já faziam parte de um programa robusto da empresa, com entregas reais, sponsors seniores e um Collaborative Challenge que os colocaria diante de problemas concretos do negócio. O que a Disney precisava era de uma jornada que desenvolvesse as ferramentas e os mindsets para enfrentar esses desafios com criatividade, autonomia e capacidade de influência.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">01</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Uncover — Apaixone-se pelo problema</h4>\n            <p>O ponto de partida era o problema — não a solução. Os participantes exploraram contextos, ouviram stakeholders, mapearam necessidades humanas e desenvolveram a disciplina de não pular etapas.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">02</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Unlock — As ideias ganham forma</h4>\n            <p>Ideação estruturada, prototipagem, testes com usuários reais, escuta ativa e capacidade de pivotar quando necessário.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">03</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Unleash — Da aprendizagem à aplicação</h4>\n            <p>Transformar protótipos em planos reais e capacitar cada trainee como agente de mudança dentro da organização.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"highlight-box\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-label\">Os três pilares do programa</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight-text\">Criatividade. Empreendedorismo. Influência.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n        <div class=\"quote-block\">\n          <p class=\"quote-text\">Curioso. Feliz. Energizado. Instigado a aprender. Em um espaço seguro.</p>\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:0.7rem; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hi-gray-light); padding: 0.5rem 0 0;\">Como os participantes descreveram sua experiência</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"project-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"section-tag\">O desenho</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Por que esse<br>programa funciona</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid two-col\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Facilitação precisa à distância</h3>\n      <p>Sessões de vinte a trinta participantes simultâneos, espalhados por três países, exigiram um design de aprendizagem capaz de manter energia e engajamento mesmo no formato remoto.</p>\n      <p>O programa foi conduzido em <strong>12 sessões de duas horas</strong>, cada uma construindo sobre a anterior em uma progressão deliberada — do entendimento profundo do problema até a aplicação e o impacto real.</p>\n      <div class=\"skill-badges\">\n        <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Criatividade</span>\n        <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Empreendedorismo</span>\n        <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Influência</span>\n        <span class=\"skill-badge\">Formato Híbrido</span>\n        <span class=\"skill-badge\">América Latina</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <h3>Stakes reais do primeiro ao último dia</h3>\n      <p>Os trainees não estavam trabalhando em casos hipotéticos. O Collaborative Challenge os colocava diante de problemas reais da Disney, com sponsors seniores acompanhando o desenvolvimento e avaliando os resultados.</p>\n      <p>Essa conexão com o negócio real foi o que transformou o aprendizado em algo que os participantes levaram para além do programa — e para dentro das equipes em que atuam.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Galeria de fotos do Disney Learning Journey -->\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery gallery-left-tall\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-tall\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/71B1AB10-FE68-46D5-B738-A3F378794C29_1_102_o.jpg?v=1777982087\" alt=\"Disney Learning Journey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/56DAF057-8CB3-4619-9E74-C0AA9951DC72_1_102_o.jpg?v=1777982084\" alt=\"Disney Learning Journey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/03591FF9-3097-4A30-B388-4B4CEBF19304_1_102_a.jpg?v=1777982078\" alt=\"Disney Learning Journey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-3\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/Captura_de_tela_2026-05-05_084923.png?v=1777982086\" alt=\"Disney Learning Journey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/65749D03-4318-4F04-80D2-A7E768B92EBE_1_102_o.jpg?v=1777982075\" alt=\"Disney Learning Journey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/9026C061-BDFF-4C9E-AD4D-64B9B91DFF66_1_102_o.jpg?v=1777982063\" alt=\"Disney Learning Journey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<!-- ================================================================ -->\n<!--  PROJETO 02 — VOICES WITH VISION                                 -->\n<!-- ================================================================ -->\n\n<div class=\"chapter-divider fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"chapter-divider-inner\">\n    <div class=\"chapter-divider-number\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"chapter-divider-content\">\n      <div class=\"chapter-divider-label\">Hackathon Transregional</div>\n      <div class=\"chapter-divider-title\">Voices with Vision</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<img class=\"fullwidth-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_222939282.MP.jpg?v=1777937598\" alt=\"Voices with Vision — Disney Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<div class=\"stats-band fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"stats-inner\">\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">1 dia</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Do briefing ao protótipo apresentado</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">3 Países</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Participando do hackathon transregional</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">Real</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Problema e stakes genuínos de negócio</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"project-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <div class=\"section-year accent\">VwV</div>\n    <div class=\"section-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"section-tag\">O conceito</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Quando a inovação<br>vira competição</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid image-text\">\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_223751903.jpg?v=1777937593\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>O <strong>Voices with Vision</strong> foi um hackathon transregional que reuniu talentos selecionados da Disney de diferentes países da América Latina em torno de um desafio comum: desenvolver um protótipo em um único dia, apresentá-lo para um comitê avaliador e defender sua viabilidade como solução real para o negócio.</p>\n      <p>O formato criou condições de aprendizagem que nenhuma sala de aula convencional consegue replicar: pressão real de tempo, problema real de negócio, stakes reais de apresentação — e a adrenalina de saber que um projeto por país seria selecionado para continuar em formato crossregion.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Da ambiguidade à clareza em horas</h4>\n            <p>A Hyper Island estruturou o dia para que cada equipe conseguisse ir do zero a uma proposta apresentável em poucas horas.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Stakes que transformam o envolvimento</h4>\n            <p>Saber que apenas um projeto por país avançaria tornava cada decisão do time genuinamente importante — e o aprendizado, visceral.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Colaboração crossregion como próximo passo</h4>\n            <p>Os projetos vencedores avançaram para uma fase de colaboração entre países, com times de culturas distintas trabalhando em torno de uma visão comum.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery gallery-right-tall\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/1777124720495.jpg?v=1777937585\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-small\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/1777124715554.jpg?v=1777937584\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item gi-tall\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/1777299642014.jpg?v=1777937584\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<section class=\"project-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n\n    <div class=\"section-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"section-tag\">A facilitação</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Um dia inteiro<br>de pressão real<br>e criação real</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid text-image\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>A Hyper Island entrou nesse contexto com sua expertise em facilitação de processos criativos sob pressão — estruturando o dia de forma que as equipes conseguissem ir da ambiguidade inicial à clareza de uma proposta apresentável em poucas horas.</p>\n      <p>O trabalho pós-hackathon, com os projetos vencedores operando em formato crossregion, adicionou uma camada de complexidade ainda maior: times de países diferentes, com culturas de trabalho distintas, precisando colaborar em torno de uma visão comum.</p>\n      <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-md);\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-label\">O que diferencia esse formato</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight-text\">Pressão real de tempo. Problema real de negócio. Aprendizado que não se esquece.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_160926381.jpg?v=1777937590\" alt=\"Facilitação Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery gallery-mixed\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-md);\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/1777296267656.jpg?v=1777937584\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_153338509.PORTRAIT.jpg?v=1777937595\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_172235247.PORTRAIT.jpg?v=1777937598\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== DEPOIMENTO VwV ==================== -->\n<div class=\"fade-up\" style=\"\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  padding: 6rem 4rem;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n\">\n  <!-- aspa decorativa de fundo -->\n  <div style=\"\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -4rem;\n    left: 3rem;\n    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 28rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: transparent;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.07);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    user-select: none;\n  \">\"</div>\n\n  <div style=\"\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 4px 1fr;\n    gap: 3rem;\n    align-items: start;\n  \">\n    <!-- barra laranja -->\n    <div style=\"background: #FF7300; width: 4px; align-self: stretch;\"></div>\n\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem;\">\n      <p style=\"\n        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n        font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.3rem);\n        font-weight: 300;\n        font-style: italic;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);\n      \">Tenho orgulho do que construímos juntos. Voices with Vision foi uma experiência que mostrou quem somos quando colocamos as pessoas, a colaboração e a curiosidade no centro. Equipes diversas, olhares distintos e muita vontade de se arriscar a imaginar e fazer. Junto à Hyper Island, criamos um espaço para aprender fazendo e desafiar o status quo, demonstrando que a inovação acontece quando damos lugar a todas as vozes e trabalhamos de forma diferente.</p>\n\n      <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 2.5rem; height: 1px; background: #FF7300; flex-shrink: 0;\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"\n            font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 1.15rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n            color: #F5F4F0;\n          \">Juliana Bianculli</div>\n          <div style=\"\n            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n            font-size: 0.7rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n            margin-top: 0.2rem;\n          \">People &amp; Culture Regional Business Partner — The Walt Disney Company</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"project-section fade-up\" style=\"padding-top: 0;\">\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-4\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_1484.jpg?v=1777937596\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_1487.jpg?v=1777937597\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_1495.jpg?v=1777937598\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_172218571.PORTRAIT.jpg?v=1777937596\" alt=\"Voices with Vision\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== VÍDEOS — VOICES WITH VISION ==================== -->\n<div class=\"video-reel-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"video-reel-header\">\n    <div class=\"video-reel-title\">Voices with Vision — o programa em movimento</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:0.7rem; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--hi-gray-light);\">Registros em vídeo</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"video-reel-grid\">\n      <div class=\"video-reel-item\">\n      <video controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_172235247.PORTRAIT.jpg?v=1777937598\">\n        <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/bf87118ecead496e97d03faf2241bdff.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n      </source></video>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"video-reel-item\">\n      <video controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_161109934.PORTRAIT.jpg?v=1777937597\">\n        <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/1ba13d605ab14e78848c449f16e0142a.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n      </source></video>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"video-reel-item\">\n      <video controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_153338509.PORTRAIT.jpg?v=1777937595\">\n        <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/cd4129c9fd0b4ab485ab3abdc32d5073.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n      </source></video>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"video-reel-item\">\n      <video controls muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20260424_172218571.PORTRAIT.jpg?v=1777937596\">\n        <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/5430c66a5fad4b398680f9995d86fd72.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n      </source></video>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<!-- ==================== CLOSING ==================== -->\n<section class=\"closing-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"closing-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"closing-client-logo\">\n        <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/Disney_logo.png\" alt=\"Disney\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"closing-label\">O que essa parceria revela</div>\n      <h2 class=\"closing-title\">O mesmo princípio<br>em dois registros<br>completamente distintos</h2>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\">\n        Uma jornada de quatro meses com trainees e um hackathon de um dia com talentos selecionados são experiências que exigem abordagens radicalmente distintas de design, facilitação e gestão de energia.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n        Em ambos os casos, o princípio subjacente foi o mesmo: colocar as pessoas em contato com desafios reais, dar a elas as ferramentas para pensar com criatividade e rigor, e criar o ambiente psicológico necessário para que o aprendizado aconteça de verdade. Essa consistência metodológica, independente do formato, é o que define a parceria com a Disney.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cta-block\">\n      <div class=\"cta-block-title\">Quer construir uma parceria assim?</div>\n      <p>Cada organização tem desafios únicos. Nossa abordagem começa pela escuta — sempre.</p>\n      <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/contato\" class=\"cta-button\" target=\"_blank\">Fale Conosco</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n    entries.forEach(entry => {\n      if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n    });\n  }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -60px 0px' });\n  document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n})();\n</script>\n\n\n</body>",
